Z||000012||fiero56||06-04-2001||11:03 PM||||So there are some still Around?!<P>There was a company that converted Fieros into EVs and used that body and setup. I threw out all my literature about the company and setup in the trash this morning, but I rememeber price was around $30K.<P>I found the info about these cars in my local library, and photo-copied everything about them. Very cool book, very cool info about these. I tossed all the photo-copies this morning, so don't have the info anymore. Maybe I'll go back this week and make another photo-copy to post here.||||reg||1
